<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Reset your password - Relisted</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f5f5f5;
      color: #111;
      padding: 24px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .wrapper {
      max-width: 520px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    }
    .header {
      background: #000;
      color: #fff;
      padding: 24px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 32px 24px;
    }
    .content p {
      margin: 0 0 16px;
      color: #333;
    }
    .otp-code {
      margin: 24px 0;
      padding: 16px 20px;
      background: #f5f5f5;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 4px;
      color: #111;
      text-align: center;
      font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    }
    .note {
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      color: #666;
      margin-top: 24px;
    }
    .warning {
      margin-top: 24px;
      padding: 12px 16px;
      background: #fff3cd;
      border-left: 4px solid #ffc107;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      color: #856404;
    }
    .footer {
      padding: 20px 24px;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: #888;
      text-align: center;
      border-top: 1px solid #eee;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Relisted</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <p>Hello {{name}},</p>
      <p>We received a request to reset your password. Use the code below to reset your password:</p>
      
      <div class="otp-code">{{code}}</div>
      
      <p class="note">
        This code expires in <strong>{{#if expiryMinutes}}{{expiryMinutes}}{{else}}10{{/if}} minutes</strong> and can only be used once.
      </p>
      
      <div class="warning">
        <strong>Security tip:</strong> If you didn't request a password reset, please ignore this email. Your account remains secure.
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      © {{currentYear}} Relisted. All rights reserved.<br />
      Buy. Sell. Relist with confidence.
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
